  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The initial and final amount of the radioactive substance are related by the formula</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is the number of half lives.</p><p>Substitute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;into equation (1) and solve to calculate the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The half-life of the radioactive element can be calculated as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (2) and solve to calculate the half-life.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>days</mi></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>t</mi><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>day</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The initial and the final mass of the radioactive element are related by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (3) and solve to calculate the initial mass of the substance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
